": "No. I did a recording with the boys, the little boy - Michael Wolff's two little boys. They were probably 9 and 7 at the time. We went in the studio, me and Michael and John B. and Roy. The boys had written this song, the kids' song. The littlest one came out and told me that I had sung it wrong. I said, \"I beg your pardon?\" He said, \"You changed the lyrics.\" I said, \"Where did I change - when ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16890$8D5BF00D-CC82-4CBA-8A9D-A3D8345F53F4", "rank": "normal"}]}}